<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy" updated="August 2026">

<h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
<p>CappadociaGo is a trading name operated by <strong>Cappadocia Kaphera Travel Agency</strong> ("we", "us", "our"), a licensed Turkish travel agency registered with the Association of Turkish Travel Agencies (TÜRSAB) under license number <strong>18577</strong>, based in Cappadocia, Nevşehir, Türkiye. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store and protect your personal data when you visit our website or book a tour with us.</p>

<h2>2. What Data We Collect</h2>
<p>Depending on how you interact with us, we may collect:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Identity &amp; contact data:</strong> full name, email address, phone number, nationality, hotel/accommodation address.</li>
  <li><strong>Booking data:</strong> selected tour, dates, number of guests, pickup location, special requests.</li>
  <li><strong>Payment data:</strong> billing details processed securely by our third-party payment providers. We do not store full card numbers on our own servers.</li>
  <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> IP address, browser type, device information, and cookies collected automatically when you browse our website (see our <a href="/legal/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a>).</li>
  <li><strong>Communication data:</strong> messages you send us via WhatsApp, email, or contact forms.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Why We Process Your Data</h2>
<p>We process your personal data for the following purposes:</p>
<ul>
  <li>To confirm and manage your tour reservation, including hotel pickup coordination.</li>
  <li>To communicate with you before, during and after your tour (confirmations, weather updates, cancellations).</li>
  <li>To process payments and issue receipts.</li>
  <li>To comply with Turkish tourism, tax and consumer protection legislation.</li>
  <li>To improve our website and services, and — only where you have given consent — to send you promotional offers.</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Legal Basis for Processing</h2>
<p>We process your data based on: (a) the performance of the booking contract between you and us; (b) our legitimate interest in operating and improving our services; (c) compliance with legal obligations under Turkish law, including the Personal Data Protection Law No. 6698 (KVKK); and (d) your explicit consent where required, such as for marketing communications.</p>

<h2>5. Who We Share Your Data With</h2>
<p>We share personal data only where necessary, with:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Tour operators and suppliers directly involved in delivering your booked experience (e.g. balloon operators, drivers, guides).</li>
  <li>Payment service providers, for the sole purpose of processing your transaction securely.</li>
  <li>Public authorities, where required by law (e.g. civil aviation authorities for balloon flight safety records).</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not sell or rent your personal data to third parties for their own marketing purposes.</p>

<div class="highlight-box">
  <strong>International transfers:</strong> If you book from outside Türkiye, your data may be processed in Türkiye where our servers and operations are based. We take appropriate measures to protect your data in line with this Policy regardless of where it is processed.
</div>

<h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
<p>We retain your booking and communication data for as long as necessary to fulfil the purposes described above, and afterwards for the period required by Turkish commercial and tax law (generally up to 10 years for financial records). Marketing data is retained only until you withdraw consent.</p>

<h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
<p>Under KVKK and applicable data protection law, you have the right to: learn whether your data is being processed; request access to your data; request correction of inaccurate data; request deletion or anonymization of your data, subject to legal retention requirements; and object to automated processing. For details on how to exercise these rights, see our <a href="/legal/kvkk">KVKK / Personal Data</a> page.</p>

<h2>8. Security</h2>
<p>We apply reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your personal data against unauthorized access, loss, or misuse. Payment transactions are processed through PCI-DSS compliant third-party providers using encrypted connections.</p>

<h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or legal requirements. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page shows when it was last revised. Continued use of our website after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated Policy.</p>

<h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
<p>For any questions, requests or complaints regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@kapheratravel.com">info@kapheratravel.com</a> or via WhatsApp at <a href="https://wa.me/905401015050">+90 540 101 50 50</a>.</p>

